      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good question. The QEMU virt platform has secure memory from 0x0e00_0000 to 0x0f00_0000, so we have plenty of space in general. BL2 is at 0xe05_b000 to 0xe06_442c, before BL31, so that\u0027s not a problem.\n\nHowever BL32 currently starts at 0x0e10_0000, so that\u0027s already a problem without this patch. I\u0027ve fixed that now by making `BL31_SIZE` smaller.",
